{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 2, "text": "《头经》是布依族《古谢经》的第一首，是在古谢的“灵房”由", "bbox_px": {"x": 250, "y": 514, "w": 1119, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "《头经》是布依族《古谢经》的第一首，是在古谢的“灵房”由", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 250, "y": 514, "w": 1119, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 3, "text": "经师细声念唱，故又叫《密咒经》。经词叙述了布依族远古社会的生", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 583, "w": 1215, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "经师细声念唱，故又叫《密咒经》。经词叙述了布依族远古社会的生", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 583, "w": 1215, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 4, "text": "活。开初，世上没有发明火的时候，人们过着群居的原始生活，没有", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 643, "w": 1211, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "活。开初，世上没有发明火的时候，人们过着群居的原始生活，没有", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 643, "w": 1211, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 5, "text": "阶级高下贵贱之分，只有劳动上的分工。没有房子住，到哪里就在哪", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 705, "w": 1211, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "阶级高下贵贱之分，只有劳动上的分工。没有房子住，到哪里就在哪", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 705, "w": 1211, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 6, "text": "里睡。后来学造房子，又做得不好，经不住风吹兩打，只得又搬迁逃", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 765, "w": 1211, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "里睡。后来学造房子，又做得不好，经不住风吹兩打，只得又搬迁逃", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 765, "w": 1211, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 7, "text": "走。经过洪水灾害的磨炼，经过劳动创造，人们终于过上了定居生", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 827, "w": 1211, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "走。经过洪水灾害的磨炼，经过劳动创造，人们终于过上了定居生", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 827, "w": 1211, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 8, "text": "活。布依族与教族、苗族、汉族、仡佬族等生活在一起，和睦相处，", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 887, "w": 1192, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "活。布依族与教族、苗族、汉族、仡佬族等生活在一起，和睦相处，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 887, "w": 1192, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 9, "text": "劳动生，逐渐发展到了商品生产，有了商品交换，有了市场。但布", "bbox_px": {"x": 151, "y": 943, "w": 1215, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "劳动生，逐渐发展到了商品生产，有了商品交换，有了市场。但布", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 151, "y": 943, "w": 1215, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 10, "text": "依族不善经商，碰到的周折太多，也对之不感兴趣了。以后，兴了葬", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 1005, "w": 1211, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "依族不善经商，碰到的周折太多，也对之不感兴趣了。以后，兴了葬", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 1005, "w": 1211, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 11, "text": "礼等习俗，兴了请经师看风水宝地。亡灵跟着经师指的路，归回到祖", "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 1068, "w": 1211, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "礼等习俗，兴了请经师看风水宝地。亡灵跟着经师指的路，归回到祖", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 155, "y": 1068, "w": 1211, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 16, "line_no": 12, "text": "宗的地方去。大家尊重经师，给他应得的礼物。这首经词可以说是全", "bbox_px": {"x": 151, "y": 1127, "w": 1215, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "宗的地方去。大家尊重经师，给他应得的礼物。这首经词可以说是全", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 151, "y": 1127, "w": 1215, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
